        "original_id": "7fb12b9b-61a5-5419-8501-2667758afe1d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Seasock\n- Companies: Advance Auto Parts, General Parts Incorporated\n- Places: Roanoke, Virginia\n- Products: Grinder\n- Events: Monster Jam World Finals Racing, General Parts Incorporated acquisition\n\nFacts:\n- John Seasock last drove Grinder, which was sponsored by Advance Auto Parts.\n- John Seasock is a two-time Monster Jam World Finals Racing Champion.\n- In October 2013, Advance Auto Parts acquired General Parts Incorporated.\n- Advance Auto Parts is headquartered in Roanoke, Virginia.\n- After acquiring General Parts Incorporated, Advance Auto Parts became the largest retailer of automotive replacement parts and accessories in the United States by store count.",
